message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "BuildLang"
abstract: "BuildLang (buildc v2.0.0) is a self-hosting deterministic systems and GPU language written in BuildLang (Stage-2 zero-C 5-ISA self-compilation across x64-pe, x64-elf, rv64-elf, aarch64-elf, and WebAssembly, with a Stage-0 Rust bootstrap). It compiles across 12 CPU and GPU targets with exact 5-way GLSL FMA parity, Superopt V7 certified e-graph rewrites, unified 4-pillar compile-time MIR assurance (--sovereign-audit), BuildOS-2.2 sovereign kernels, and 600/600 certified GPU compute shaders."
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-27"
